Z||000006||stimpy||08-04-2000||10:45 PM||||I have a low restriction system in my 86 GT. 2.5" pipe, low restriction cat and Flowmaster. Have had no problem with my idle, although it does make my check engine light flash codes for my O2 sensor. Any ideas on how to fix that guys?||||reg||1
